      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### External sites\n\n* Code coverage & benchmarks: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36844\n* Ralph review <img src=https://review.fish.foo/assets/bitcoin/bitcoin/36844.png alt=\"Ralph review status\"> https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36844#author-ralph\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36843](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36843) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36843.svg\"></sub> (scripted-diff: [test] Add util/check.h includes for assertions by maflcko)\n* [#36598](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36598) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36598.svg\"></sub> ([Demo] validation: remove AssumeUTXO by l0rinc)\n* [#36114](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36114) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/36114.svg\"></sub> (wallet: harden external signer psbt processing, revamp mock by Sjors)\n* [#35671](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35671) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35671.svg\"></sub> (mining: add TxCollection to bandwidth-efficiently validate external block templates by Sjors)\n* [#35642](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35642) <sub><img src=\"https://drahtbot.space/ack_count/bitcoin/bitcoin/35642.svg\"></sub> (headersync: do parameter search at runtime by sipa)\n* [#35229](https://git